[b][size=5]Description[/size][/b]
[color=#d4d4d8]With this mod you can analyse your Appraised Talismans to find those you don't need, either because you own them multiple times or a better one. [b]It only shows the Talismans[/b], you decide yourself if you want to sell, meld or leave them.[/color]
[color=#d4d4d8][size=3][b]Does NOT include craftable Talismans![/b][/size][/color]

[b][size=5]Main features[/size][/b]
[list]
[*][color=#d4d4d8]view all your Appraised Talismans including how many you own[/color][/*]
[*][color=#d4d4d8]view your duplicated Appraised Talismans and how many times you own each[/color][/*]
[*]view your obsolete Appraised Talismans including the better ones
[list]
[*]comes with an option to not compare Slots if the Skills are better[/*]
[/list]
[/*]
[/list]

[b][size=5]Definition of obsolete Talismans[/size][/b]
A Talisman is considered obsolete when either:
[list]
[*]another one has the same Skills but at least one Skill is on a higher level
[list]
[*]Slots must be better or equal (can be disabled)[/*]
[/list]
[/*]
[*]another has the same Skills plus an additional one(s)
[list]
[*]Slots must be better or equal (can be disabled)[/*]
[/list]
[/*]
[*]another has the exact same Skills but better Slots[/*]
[/list]
A Talisman has better Slots when either:
[list]
[*]the Talisman has the same Slot(type)s but at least one Slot is on a higher level[/*]
[*]the Talisman has the same Slot(type)s plus an additional one(s)[/*]
[/list]
[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/images/6993/175266303-1779660518.png[/img]

[b][size=5]Usage[/size][/b]

[center][color=#ffff00][size=4][b]I'm currently working on a way to automatically select the talismans in the melding pot UI.[/b][/size][/color][/center]

[list=1]
[*]click on "Analyse Talismans"[/*]
[*]click on either "Show Duplicated Talismans" or "Show Obsolete Talismans"[/*]
[*]in the Camp or the Melding Pot menu use the sorting functionality to sort by one of the Talisman's Skills
[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/images/6993/175266303-1779661860.png[/img][/*]
[*]identify the Talismans based on their Skills and Slots
[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/images/6993/175266303-1779661915.png[/img][/*]
[*][color=#cc0000][b]double check if you really want to sell/meld that Talisman! [/b][/color][/*]
[*]after selling/melding some talismans click on "Re-Analyse Talismans" (replaced "Analyse Talismans") to remove them from the list[/*]
[/list]

[b][size=5]Installation instructions[/size][/b]
use Fluffy Mod Manager

